sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant H as Central Harness
    participant M as SwTrackController
    participant W as TrackController (wayside)
    participant S as TrackControllerState
    participant UI as Track Controller UI (QML)
    participant CTC as CTC Office
    participant TM as Track Model
    H->>M: step(dt, inputs)
    alt no track loaded
        M->>M: _outputs internal: no waysides, nothing listed
        M-->>H: return empty outputs, no reports
    else a wayside on the line has no program
        M->>M: step internal: _waiting_lines() lists the line
        loop each wayside of that line
            M->>W: idle(line is not ready)
            W->>W: idle internal: track_circuits, switch_commands, aspects := empty, crossing_commands := every crossing armed, overrides := not_running
        end
        M->>M: _report internal: ready false, reason no PLC program
        M-->>H: return no commands for the line, reports with ready false
        H->>CTC: STEP: reports, no PLC program
        CTC->>CTC: step internal: hold the line: no dispatch, no suggestions
        Note right of TM: Receives no switch, signal or track circuit command for the line. Its crossings are commanded armed (the default).
        UI->>S: ready, notReadyReason
        S->>M: not_ready_reasons()
        M-->>S: return the waysides with no PLC program
        S-->>UI: return NOT READY, with the reason
    end
    Note over H,W: A wayside running nothing cannot drive switches, signals or circuits: those are absent, not safe defaults. Its crossings stay armed. The other line is not held.
